WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.558
Saving the question does not save the whole search

00:00:40.558 --> 00:01:25.452
Record four areas of the pipeline

00:01:25.452 --> 00:02:10.697
Repeatability still depends on the indexed system

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:52.277
Dense retrieval is not inherently random

00:02:52.277 --> 00:03:35.588
Visible terms and alignments still need their versions

00:03:35.588 --> 00:04:20.517
Reusing an input differs from generating a new one

00:04:20.517 --> 00:04:58.695
Record actions and observations, not narrated reasoning

00:04:58.695 --> 00:05:49.933
Start with the evidence you can preserve today
